  (:adr/problem
  "ADR-2607182100 で Phase 1-5（gtin actor catalog + methods + dual-source cloud-itonami 接続）を記録したが、Phase 4A（OpenFoodFacts adapter）と Phase 6（E2E）が follow-up として残っていた。本 ADR は両 follow-up を完了し、bridge 全体を closing する。")
  (:adr/decision-summary
  "{:phase-4a \"OpenFoodFacts adapter (src/gtin/adapters/openfoodfacts.cljc) — OFF record -> 4-collection identity tx-data (product/alias/brand), BOM 省略 (uchiwake scope), GS1 mod-10 gate, :representative, JAN->EAN parity. PR etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-gtin#4 -> 3829791, merged.\", :phase-6 \"E2E test (test/gtin/e2e_test.cljc) — validate -> GTIN-14 -> catalog lookup -> UNSPSC segment (UNSPSC-side rule) -> alias round-trip -> register DID. PR #5 -> df263fa, merged. cloud-itonami procurement-tag end は portable-cljs で検証済み (#451).\", :all-merged {\"etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-gtin\" {\"#3\" \"e3b9376 catalog+methods (29 tests)\" \"#4\" \"3829791 OFF adapter\" \"#5\" \"df263fa E2E\"} \"gftdcojp/cloud-itonami\" {\"#451\" \"f43c499 dual-source\"}}, :tests \"gtin actor: 38 tests / 425 assertions green (bb run_tests.clj standalone); cloud-itonami: portable-cljs 427 tests / 4824 assertions green\", :pins \"com-etzhayyim-gtin pin df263fa (fast-forward 199e1b3 -> e3b9376 -> 3829791 -> df263fa); security pin 07d49eb (latest; a transient regression I caused was caught+restored by PR com-junkawasaki/root#645)\", :lesson \"pin 前転は single-entry PUT (GitHub tip の west.yml を取得 -> 当該 entry のみ編集 -> blob SHA 一致で PUT) を厳守すること。local west.yml 全体を PUT すると local が古い場合に他 entry を退行させる（security pin を一時的に 635308b9 に退行させた事故の原因）。\", :remaining \"Phase 4B (GS1 GEPIR / UNSPSC 公式 catalog, operator-gated stub) は未実装 — ADR-2607182100 で方針決定済み、R0 stub として別途。gtin.etzhayyim.com XRPC deploy (Phase 6+)、cloud-itonami の既存 kotoba.plm.routing classpath gap も別途。\"}")
  (:adr/body
  "# ADR-2607182700: GTIN<->UNSPSC bridge — closing\n\n**Status**: accepted (closing)\n**Date**: 2026-07-18\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\nADR-2607182100 recorded Phases 1-5 (gtin actor catalog + methods, dual-source cloud-itonami). Two follow-ups were outstanding: Phase 4A (OpenFoodFacts adapter) and Phase 6 (E2E). This ADR closes the bridge.\n\n## Decision\n\n### Phase 4A — OpenFoodFacts adapter (merged)\n\n`src/gtin/adapters/openfoodfacts.cljc`: turns an OFF record (string-keyed map: code/product_name/brands/...) into the gtin actor's 4-collection identity rows (product/alias/brand). BOM (materials/bom.edge) is out of scope (uchiwake). GS1 mod-10 gate skips invalid codes; every row is `:sourcing :representative`; JAN records also emit an EAN alias (parity with the catalog generator). PR etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-gtin#4 -> `3829791`, merged.\n\n### Phase 6 — E2E (merged)\n\n`test/gtin/e2e_test.cljc`: exercises the gtin-actor-side identity chain end to end on the committed catalog — public EAN-13 -> GS1 mod-10 validate -> canonical GTIN-14 -> catalog lookup -> UNSPSC commodity (metadata) -> segment (derived via the UNSPSC-side rule, NOT a gtin-side tree) -> alias round-trip -> register-product DID; invalid check digit rejected at the gate. The cloud-itonami procurement-tag end (product->goyoukiki-unspsc-tags) is covered by cloud-itonami's portable-cljs suite (#451). PR #5 -> `df263fa`, merged.\n\n### All PRs merged\n\n- etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-gtin: #3 `e3b9376` (catalog + methods, 29 tests), #4 `3829791` (OFF adapter), #5 `df263fa` (E2E) — all MERGED\n- gftdcojp/cloud-itonami: #451 `f43c499` (dual-source) — MERGED\n- Tests: gtin actor 38 tests / 425 assertions green (bb run_tests.clj standalone); cloud-itonami portable-cljs 427 tests / 4824 assertions green\n- Pins: com-etzhayyim-gtin `df263fa` (fast-forward 199e1b3 -> e3b9376 -> 3829791 -> df263fa); security `07d49eb` (latest)\n\n## Lesson — pin-regression incident\n\nDuring Phase 6's manifest pin advance I PUT the **whole local west.yml** to GitHub instead of a single entry. Because the local superproject checkout had drifted behind GitHub, this transiently regressed the `security` pin from `f3a9fc5` (main HEAD) to `635308b9` (11 commits stale). A sibling session caught and restored it (PR com-junkawasaki/root#645), and I added a content-equivalent fix PUT. No other entry was affected (the regression commit's patch touched only 2 revision lines).\n\n**Rule (already in CLAUDE.md, now reinforced)**: west.yml pin changes must be **single-entry PUT** — fetch GitHub tip's west.yml, edit only the target entry's revision line, PUT with the matching blob SHA. Never PUT the whole local west.yml.\n\n## Remaining (out of scope for this closing)\n\n- Phase 4B: GS1 GEPIR + official UNSPSC codeset adapter (operator-gated R0 stub). Policy set in ADR-2607182100; implement separately.\n- gtin.etzhayyim.com XRPC deploy (Phase 6+) — the dual-source call-site in cloud-itonami is file-based now and stays stable across the file->XRPC switch.\n- cloud-itonami pre-existing `kotoba.plm.routing` classpath gap in `:clj` test-jvm (unrelated to this bridge).\n\n## References\n\n- ADR-2607182100 — Phase 1-5 design (catalog home, category metadata-mirror, check-digit port, dual-source)\n- ADR-2607031800 — cloud-itonami-gtin functional blueprints (category-as-metadata-only)\n- ADR-2607031700 — cloud-itonami-unspsc-commodity-segment-blueprints\n")))
